			DRAGON FEAR   
|YK0================================================================|YKB

'Weakness is the greatest weakness of all.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster Maelstrom 
|YK0
In the form of the Dragon, a Monk can channel the all powerful
Dragon fear which can drive a foe insane. This can lead them to 
freeze on the spot or to run away.

|YKBThis is a Master of Summer power.
